Ponte Desk adds in-process LAN coordination, input-origin filtering, cooperative
agent isolation, automatic shared-display management and native macOS UI.
The display-enable API was researched using Vorssaint (GPL-3.0):
https://github.com/vorssaint/vorssaint-utils
The implementation in native/macos/PonteDesk.swift is specific to this project.

Webcam module additions:
- CMIO producer protocol researched using VirtualCamera4Mac v0.0.7
  (Apache-2.0), m96-chan/VirtualCamera4Mac. This earlier system component
  is not bundled in release 0.3; the producer retains its provenance notice.
- Windows Media Foundation source derived from smourier/VCamSample (MIT),
  Microsoft WIL (MIT) and C++/WinRT (MIT); full notices in native/windows/webcam/.

